id=a52sxq_kernel_bone_machine
name=Galaxy A52s 5G: bone-machine kernel 5.4.302 (TEST, disabled by default)
author=kusti420
description=Replaces the stock A528BXXU5FWK4 kernel (Linux 5.4.233, Nov 2023) with bone-machine's One UI kernel, Linux 5.4.302-bone-machine-qgki (final 5.4 LTS sublevel), built 2026-10-04 by GitHub Actions run 37200490865 from https://github.com/mna08072-cmyk/android_kernel_samsung_sm7325_a52s_5g commit 6806314d69f2bf73199a2f31ea177b5b9b48f4af (branch resukisu-oneui; upstream bone-machine/android_kernel_samsung_sm7325_a52s_5g). Artifact prebuilts/kernel/bone-machine/bone-machine_2026-10-04_One-UI_ReSukiSU-v4.2.0-rc3_a52sxq.zip, sha256 62580f19ff3031fe2c7e12548d0c0c3677362a11117d89a0091f5107f592c128. Swaps only the kernel Image inside our boot.img (our ramdisk, cmdline and 2023-11 OS patch level stay), and uses the release's vendor_boot.img (same first-stage fstab, its 84 modules rebuilt for this kernel incl. wlan.ko, matching dtb) and dtbo.img. NOTE: the kernel has ReSukiSU (KernelSU fork) built in (dormant without its manager app) and Samsung Knox/RKP/KDP/DEFEX/PROCA/FIVE/DSMS disabled.
